      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Ecstatic after his phone call from Moscow, Governor Viktor Stepanovich hurries to share the grand news with his loyal aide Stepanych. Visions of wealth and influence fill his mind as he prepares to collect the funds. Let's listen in Russian first.",
